            "identifier": "SCENE_BREAKFAST_ROOM",
            "location_header": "INT. BREAKFAST ROOM - MORNING",
            "visual_description": "A sunny Victorian breakfast room with tall sash windows overlooking a garden. A large mahogany table is set with crisp white linens and gleaming silver service. Warm morning light floods the room, illuminating rich cream wallpaper and polished wood accents."
          },
          {
