            "location_header": "INT. UPSTAIRS CORRIDOR - DAWN",
            "visual_description": "The long Victorian corridor in the grey, flat light of early dawn. Shadows are softer but the air is cold and still. A makeshift scarecrow-like figure stands slumped against the wainscoting. The atmosphere is pale, quiet, and slightly absurd."
          }
        ]
